[Comment]     =  "Amorphous ribbon: Metglas 2605SA1 and 2605HB1M after Metglas's longitudinal field anneal.  Each normal curve is built from the single-strip DC loops (Hm 8 and 80 A/m) of Metglas's 'Amorphous Alloys for Transformer Cores' (2011) and passes through both loop tips; above 80 A/m nothing is measured and the curve is a law-of-approach tail to the given saturation (1.56 and 1.63 T), bounded within 0.13 T.  Ribbon 25 um (d_lam); LamFill 0.84, Metglas's lamination factor for these alloys (>= 84 %).  Materials only, no geometry."
